---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Container from '../../components/layout/Container.astro';
import Header from '../../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import H1 from '../../components/typography/H1.astro';
import H2 from '../../components/typography/H2.astro';
import P from '../../components/typography/P.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/layout/Breadcrumb.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../../components/seo/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Terms of Use | Megaways Online';
const pageDescription =
	'The terms for using megawaysonline.com: an 18+ informational review site, not a gambling operator. Accuracy, demo games, affiliate links and liability explained.';

const breadcrumbItems = [
	{ label: 'Home', href: '/' },
	{ label: 'Terms of Use', href: '/terms/' },
];

const lastUpdated = '2026-07-14';

const linkClass = 'underline hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-primary-400';
---

<PageLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
	<BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbItems} />
	<Header slot='header' />

	<Container>
		<Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbItems} class='mb-6' />

		<article class='max-w-3xl mb-16'>
			<header class='mb-10'>
				<H1 size='lg'>Terms of Use</H1>
				<P class='text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Last updated: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>14 July 2026</time>
				</P>
			</header>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>What this site is</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Megaways Online (megawaysonline.com) publishes reviews, guides and information
					about online slot games and casinos. It is operated by Duwayne Cowney as an
					independent publisher — we are <strong>not</strong> a casino, we do not offer
					real-money gambling, accept wagers or hold player funds. By using this site you
					accept these terms; if you do not accept them, please do not use the site.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Age and jurisdiction</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					This site is for adults aged <strong>18 or over</strong> (or the higher legal
					gambling age where you live). Online gambling is regulated differently in every
					country and is illegal in some. Nothing on this site is an invitation to gamble
					where it is unlawful. It is your responsibility to check that any casino you
					visit is lawful and licensed for your jurisdiction before you register or
					deposit.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Accuracy of information</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					We verify game statistics such as RTP, volatility and maximum win against
					official provider data before publishing, and we date every review. However,
					providers change RTP configurations, casinos change bonus terms, and games are
					withdrawn — so all content is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; for general
					information only, without warranty of completeness or current accuracy, and does
					not constitute financial, legal or gambling advice. Always confirm the figures
					in the game's own paytable and the casino's own terms before playing.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Free demo games</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					Demo games on this site are free, play-money versions hosted and operated by the
					game providers, embedded for evaluation only. No real money can be staked or won
					in them, and no purchase is possible through this site. Demos are provided by
					third parties: we cannot guarantee their availability, and they may be
					restricted in some regions.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Demo results are randomised play-money outcomes — they do not predict or
					guarantee real-money results, and the RTP configuration of a real-money game at
					a specific casino may differ from the demo. The 18+ age restriction applies to
					demo play as it does to the rest of the site. See also how demos are handled in
					our <a href='/privacy/' class={linkClass}>privacy policy</a>.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Affiliate links and editorial independence</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Some outbound casino links are affiliate links: if you sign up through them we
					may earn a commission at no cost to you. This is how the site is funded, and it
					is disclosed on the pages where such links appear. Commercial relationships
					never influence ratings or editorial content — reviews are researched and scored
					the same way whether or not an affiliate programme exists. See our
					<a href='/about/methodology/' class={linkClass}>methodology</a>
					for how reviews are produced.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Third-party sites</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Casinos and other external sites we link to are operated by third parties under
					their own terms and privacy policies. We are not responsible for their content,
					offers, payouts or conduct. Any dispute with a casino is between you and that
					operator and its regulator.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Intellectual property and acceptable use</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					The reviews, guides and original content on this site are ours and may not be
					republished, scraped or redistributed without permission, beyond brief quotation
					with attribution. Game names, artwork and trademarks (including
					Megaways&trade;, a trademark of Big Time Gaming) belong to their respective
					owners and are referenced for identification and review purposes only. You agree
					not to use the site in any way that disrupts it or circumvents its security.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Limitation of liability</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					To the maximum extent permitted by law, Megaways Online and its operator are not
					liable for any loss arising from use of this site or reliance on its content —
					including gambling losses, casino disputes, demo-game availability, or decisions
					made on the basis of published statistics. Nothing in these terms excludes
					liability that cannot be excluded by law. Gambling involves risk: never stake
					more than you can afford to lose, and see our
					<a href='/responsible-gambling/' class={linkClass}>responsible gambling resources</a>
					if play stops being fun.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-0'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>General</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa, without
					affecting any consumer protections you are entitled to under the laws of the
					country where you live. If any part of these terms is found unenforceable, the
					rest remains in effect. We may update these terms from time to time; the date
					above shows the current version, and continued use of the site after an update
					constitutes acceptance. Questions? Email
					<a href='mailto:hello@megawaysonline.com' class={linkClass}>hello@megawaysonline.com</a>.
				</P>
			</section>
		</article>
	</Container>

	<Footer slot='footer' />
</PageLayout>
